B.ke=new A.a4(B.a6D,["Ikhaya","Izifundo","Ikhalenda","Imiyalezo","Iphrofayela","Izilungiselelo","Ulimi","IsiNgisi","IsiZulu","Isibonelo","INKUNDLA YABAFUNDI","INDAWO YAKHO YOKUFUNDA","Siyakwamukela futhi","Inombolo yomfundi","Iphasiwedi","Ngikhumbule","Ngena","Phuma","Ukhohlwe iphasiwedi?","Ukubuyisa iphasiwedi","Isicelo sokubuyisa iphasiwedi","Ngena endaweni yakho yokufunda. Ama-akhawunti aphethwe yisikole.","Inombolo yomfundi noma iphasiwedi ayilungile. Zama i-akhawunti yesibonelo engezansi.","KHETHA I-AKHAWUNTI YESIBONELO","LUCKY DUBE \xb7 ISIBONELO","Konke ukufunda kwakho ndawonye","Hlala uxhumene nesikole sakho","Thuthuka nsuku zonke","Bheka izifundo, iziqondiso zokufunda nomsebenzi wasekhaya ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.","Landela izaziso nezingxoxo zesibonelo ezilawulwa yisikole.","Landelela ukufunda kwakho, hlela isonto lakho futhi uveze ubuciko bakho.","Okulandelayo","Okwedlule","Qala","Yeqa isingeniso","Inikezwe yi-OG Technologies SA","Khansela","Qinisekisa","Londoloza","Vala","Emuva","Kwenziwe","Konke","Okuzayo","Kuthunyelwe","Sekwephuzile","Sekumakiwe","Okulondoloziwe","Sesha endaweni yakho yokufunda","Izifundo zakho","Izifundo zakho zesibonelo \u2022 Ithemu 4","Indawo yesifundo sakho","Ukubuka konke","Izifundo","Izinsiza","Imisebenzi","Ukuhlola","Imiphumela","Izingxoxo","Isifundo","Insiza","Umsebenzi","Imibuzo yokuzilolonga","Umphumela","Umsebenzi wasekhaya","Izinsiza","Umtapo wezinsiza zokufunda","Izinsiza zokufunda","Umsebenzi wasekhaya nemisebenzi","Ukuhlola kokuzilolonga","Imiphumela yokufunda","Qhubeka nokufunda","Imisebenzi yasekhaya","Imiphumela ekhishiwe","Izingxoxo zekilasi","Vula ingxoxo yekilasi","Izinhloso zokufunda","Isiqondiso sokubuyekeza esitholakala ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","Maka njengokuqediwe","Kuqediwe","Beka uphawu","Kuphawuliwe","Landa ukuze usebenzise ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","Kuyatholakala ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","Iyalanda\u2026","Impendulo ebhaliwe","Khetha amafayela kule divayisi","Londoloza uhlaka","Uhlaka lulondolozwe kule divayisi","Thumela umsebenzi","Thumela futhi","Faka impendulo ebhaliwe noma ifayela ngaphambi kokuthumela.","Umsebenzi uthunyelwe ukuze ubuyekezwe","Umsebenzi wamukelwe kule divayisi \u2022 Ulinde ukumakwa.","Ukuphawula kukathisha kuzovela ngemva kokubuyekeza kwesibonelo.","Isifinyezo sokuzilolonga","Phuma ekuzilolongeni","Phawula ukuze ubuyekeze","Thumela izimpendulo","Uthumela izimpendulo zokuzilolonga?","Buyekeza","Thumela","Impendulo ebhaliwe \u2022 imakwa nguthisha","Ukuzilolonga kuqediwe","Iyiphi indlela esiza ukufunda okunembayo?","Kopisha ngaphandle kokuhlola","Zilolonge bese uzindla","Qagela ngokushesha","Iqiniso noma amanga: ukuhlola umsebenzi wakho kungaveza amaphutha.","Iqiniso","Amanga","Yibuphi ubufakazi obuqinile bokusekela isiphetho?","Amahemuhemu","Umbono ongenabo ubufakazi","Isibonelo esisetshenziwe nokuchaza okucacile","Chaza ukuthi ungawusebenzisa kanjani lo mbono esifundweni sakho.","Kulungile","Akulungile","Umphumela okhishiwe","Ukuphawula kukathisha","Uhlelo lwezikhathi","Uhlelo lwakho lwezikhathi","Ukuya esikoleni","Izaziso","Izaziso zesikole","Ubuciko bokudlala","Izaziso","Maka konke njengokufundiwe","Susa isaziso","Kufundiwe","Akufundiwe","Iphrofayela yakho","Imininingwane esemthethweni yomfundi ayiguquleki","Ubumfihlo nolwazi lohlelo","Mayelana ne-Lucky Dube","Yenza le ndawo ivumelane nawe","Ukubukeka nokufinyeleleka","Ukubukeka kwedivayisi","Ukubukeka okukhanyayo","Ukubukeka okumnyama","Usayizi wombhalo","Izilungiselelo zezaziso kule divayisi","Ama-akhawunti esibonelo","Ukuphatha okulandiwe","Sula okugciniwe kwesikhashana","Setha kabusha idatha yesibonelo","Usetha kabusha yonke idatha yesibonelo?","Lokhu kushintsha idatha yesibonelo kule divayisi kuphela.","Usizo nokuphepha komfundi","Usizo","Usizo nokwesekwa","Udinga usizo manje?","Bika ukukhathazeka \u2022 Isibonelo esiyimfihlo","Ukuxhashazwa","Ukuhlukunyezwa","Izinkinga zokufunda","Izinkinga zokuphepha","Ukuxhumana okungafanele","Izinkinga zobuchwepheshe","Faka imininingwane","Sicela ufake imininingwane ngaphambi kokulondoloza.","Imininingwane yakho igcinwa kule divayisi yesibonelo kuphela.","Chaza okukukhathazayo (ungafaki imininingwane eyimfihlo)","Incazelo yokungabikho","Chaza ukungabikho","Isikhumbuzi sakho","Faka isikhumbuzi sakho","Ikhalenda lakho","Hlela ukufunda nokuzilolonga kwakho kobuciko","Isonto","Kwamasonto onke","Okokufunda","Okujwayelekile","Okubalulekile","Indawo yezaziso","Phawula isaziso","Umculo","Umdanso","Idrama","Ukukhiqiza kwezobuchwepheshe","Umsindo nokukhanyisa","Isikhungo sobuciko bokudlala","Ukulungiselela ukudlala","Ukuzifudumeza kuqediwe","Izinsiza sezilungile","Amanothi okuzilolonga abuyekeziwe","Umsebenzi wobuciko usulungile","Iqoqo lakho lomsebenzi eliyimfihlo","Faka iphrojekthi yobuciko","Isihloko nencazelo yephrojekthi","Iphrojekthi eqoqweni lomsebenzi","Othisha","Amaqembu","Abantu ofunda nabo. Izingxoxo eziwusizo endaweni efanele.","Sixhumene ngokunakekelana","Iziteshi eziphethwe othisha namaqembu aqondiswayo. Zonke izimpendulo zothisha lapha ziyisibonelo kuphela.","Sesha izingxoxo","Azikho izingxoxo ezihambisana nokusesha kwakho. Zama elinye igama noma iqembu.","Buza umbuzo noma uthole usizo lokufunda","Izindaba zekilasi lakho endaweni eyodwa","Yabelanani ngemibono futhi niphendule imibuzo","Ukuzilolonga, umsebenzi wobuciko nokusebenzisana","UTHISHA WEKILASI","IQEMBU ELIQONDISWAYO","Qala ingxoxo","Impendulo yakamuva \u2022 Isibonelo","Uthisha wekilasi \u2022 Kuphethwe othisha","Iqembu lokufunda eliqondiswayo","Izinketho zengxoxo","Thulisa ingxoxo","Susa ukuthulisa ingxoxo","Bika ukuxhumana","Yabelana ngefayela","Thumela umlayezo","Phendula kulesi siteshi","Bhala umlayezo ocacile nonenhlonipho\u2026","Izingxoxo ezigunyazwe yisikole \u2022 Zigcinwe kule divayisi","Isiteshi sesibonelo \u2022 Izimpendulo zothisha ziyisibonelo","Uthisha \u2022 Impendulo yesibonelo","Uthisha \u2022 Isibonelo","Wena","Kulondolozwe kule divayisi","FUNDA \u2022 DALA \u2022 THUTHUKA","Imibono emikhulu.","Amathuba aqhakazile.","Ikhono elisha, umbono wobuciko, igxathu eliya phambili.","Yenza usuku lwanamuhla lube isahluko sakho esihle.","Inqubekelaphambili yokufunda","Isilinganiso esikhishiwe","Izifundo eziqediwe","Imisebenzi okufanele iqedwe","Amathuluzi akho okufunda","Okulandelayo","Qhubeka ngendlela efanele","Izibalo","Isayensi Yemvelo","Isayensi Yezenhlalo","Ubuchwepheshe","Isayensi Yezomnotho Nokuphatha","Amakhono Empilo","Ubuciko Bokuqamba","IJografi","Ubuciko Bedrama","Sawubona, ","Ibanga ","Ithemu ","Uthisha wekilasi","Iqembu lekilasi eliqondiswayo","Ingxoxo yezibalo","Iqembu lobuciko bokudlala","Hlola ","isiqondiso sokubuyekeza","imibuzo yokuzilolonga","ukuhlola kwethemu","Umsebenzi wethemu 4","ULwesine","Novemba","UMsombuluko","ULwesibili","ULwesithathu","ULwesihlanu","Ikhefu","Inhloso yokufunda: chaza imiqondo esemqoka, uyisebenzise esibonelweni futhi ucabange ngendlela osebenze ngayo.\n\n1. Funda umbuzo ngokucophelela ubone imininingwane oyinikiwe.\n2. Chaza umqondo ngamazwi akho.\n3. Sebenzisa isibonelo bese uhlola impendulo yakho.\n\nIzinsiza zesibonelo zenziwe yi-Optimal Growth Technologies SA. Akukho okuqukethwe kwezincwadi okukopishiwe.","Uma kunesimo esiphuthumayo sangempela, xhumana ngokushesha nomuntu omdala onokwethenjelwa noma abezimo eziphuthumayo. Lolu hlelo lwesibonelo aluthumeli imibiko kothisha noma kwabezimo eziphuthumayo.","Siyakwamukela! Hloniphanani lapha, buzani imibuzo futhi nisizane ekufundeni.","Siyabonga ngomlayezo wakho. Buyekeza isiqondiso sokufunda bese uletha imibuzo esifundweni esilandelayo.","Akukho okuhambisana nokusesha kwakho. Zama ukusesha okunye.","Imininingwane esemthethweni yesikole ayiguquleki.","Iphasiwedi yawo wonke ama-akhawunti: Demo123!","Isibonelo kuphela: akukho sicelo esithunyelwe. Ohlelweni lwangempela, xhumana nomphathi wama-akhawunti wesikole. Iphasiwedi yesibonelo: Demo123!","Ukuchaza kwakho kucacile. Veza zonke izinyathelo ukuze impendulo inembe. Lo mphumela wesibonelo awuguquleki.","Zindla: chaza umqondo owodwa owufundile nombuzo owodwa ongathanda ukuwubuza ekilasini.","Impendulo ebhaliwe: ilinde ukumakwa kwesibonelo. Lokhu ukuzilolonga kuphela; akushintshi imiphumela esemthethweni.","Xoxa ngokufunda neqembu eligunyazwe yisikole. Izimpendulo zothisha zesibonelo zikhonjiswe ngokucacile.","Lesi sifundo asabelwe iphrofayela yakho yomfundi.","Lesi siteshi asabelwe iphrofayela yakho yomfundi.","Lokhu okuqukethwe akwabelwe iphrofayela yakho. Buyela ezifundweni zakho ukhethe okutholakalayo.","Umbiko ugcinwe kule divayisi kuphela. Ukuze uthole usizo lwangempela, xhumana nomuntu omdala onokwethenjelwa.","Indawo yakho yokufunda isesikhathini","Umsebenzi wobuciko wangempela \u2022 Uyimfihlo","Kuyimfihlo \u2022 akushicilelwa emphakathini","Isicelo sesibonelo esiyimfihlo \u2022 silinde ukubuyekezwa ngothisha","Amarekhodi esikole esibonelo awaguquleki","Susa izimpawu zezinsiza ezilandiwe","Kususa ukungena, imisebenzi ethunyelwe nezilungiselelo zendawo","Izinsiza ezilondoloziwe nezilandiwe","Kulondolozwe kule divayisi \u2022 Kulinde ukubuyekezwa kwesibonelo","Cela ukuqinisekiswa kokuba khona ekuzilolongeni","Londoloza isicelo sosizo sesibonelo esiyimfihlo","Usizo ohambweni lwakho lokufunda","Ususa izimpawu zezinsiza ezilandiwe?","Usula umlando wokubukwe kamuva?","Sula izinsiza ezibukwe kamuva","Veza izwi lakho. Thuthukisa ikhono lakho. Yabelana ngobuciko bakho.","Esigungwini \u2022 Ikusasa lobuciko","Ukuzilolongela umbukiso wobuciko","Isikhumbuzi sokuzilolongela umbukiso wobuciko","Umbukiso wobuciko \u2022 Uphiniwe","Umbukiso wobuciko wokuphela konyaka","Isaziso esibalulekile sokuphepha kwabafundi","Isikhathi sokubuyekeza izibalo","Imiphumela ekhishiwe isiyatholakala","Amalungiselelo okuvalwa kwesikole","Othisha namaqembu aqondiswayo","Impendulo entsha kathisha yesibonelo","Umcimbi wesibonelo ophethwe yisikole. Indawo: igumbi lobuciko noma ihholo lesikole. Letha izinsiza zakho zokufunda ufike kusasele imizuzu eyishumi.","Sebenzisa izinkinobho zokuhamba ukuze ubuyele endaweni yakho yokufunda.","Sebenzisa inombolo yakho yomfundi ne-Demo123!; awukwazi ukuzibhalisa ngokwakho.","Zonke iziqondiso nokuqukethwe kwesibonelo kugcinwe kule divayisi.","Vula Umsebenzi wasekhaya, khetha umsebenzi, faka impendulo yakho bese uyithumela. Uhlaka lugcinwa kule divayisi.","Iqoqo lakho lomsebenzi lesibonelo liyimfihlo futhi ligcinwe kule divayisi.","Ubani ongafunda iqoqo lami lomsebenzi?","Ngingena kanjani?","Ngingafunda ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi?","Ngiwuthumela kanjani umsebenzi wasekhaya?","Ulwazi lomakhi, ubunikazi nesibonelo","Usuku lokugcina lomsebenzi wethemu 4","Ithemu 4 \u2022 Ukubuyekeza nokusebenzisa ubuciko","Bheka izifundo zakho, lungiselela imisebenzi futhi uzilolonge ngaphambi kokuhlola kokugcina.","Chaza isihloko ngamazwi akho, unikeze isibonelo esisodwa futhi uchaze ukuthi uyihlole kanjani impendulo yakho. Thumela impendulo ebhaliwe noma ifayela kule divayisi. Ungathumela futhi.","Okuqukethwe kokufunda","Isifundo asitholakali","Ingxoxo ayitholakali","Kwanyanga zonke","Ukubuka inyanga","Isonto elikhethiwe","Umlando wokuya esikoleni","Ukulungiselela izivivinyo","Isiqondiso sokufunda sethemu 4","Umhlangano wokubuyekeza nabazali","Ukudlala kokuphela konyaka","Ukuhlela amaholide esikole","Kukhishiwe","Kuyimfihlo","Ukhona","Akekho","Ufike sekwephuzile","amamaki","amamaki emibuzo enezimpendulo eziqondile","Kulindiwe","Ukuzilolonga kuphela","okusele","Umbuzo ","Kulinde ukumakwa","Kufanele kuthunyelwe ngo-","Igumbi ","Okwamanje","Isifinyezo sokuya esikoleni","Igumbi lokuzilolonga","Yazisa","Ukuzilolonga","izibalo","isiNgisi","isiZulu","ijografi","umculo","isayensi yemvelo","isayensi yezenhlalo","ubuchwepheshe","ubuciko bokuqamba","amakhono empilo","unyaka wesikole","imisebenzi elindile","umsebenzi olindile","Umphumela wakamuva","Isifundo esilandelayo","Umphumela wokuhlola okhishiwe awuguquleki.","Isithombe sephrofayela","Inqubekelaphambili encane nsuku zonke","Ulimi olukhethiwe lulondoloziwe","Khetha ulimi","Izinsiza zokufunda","Sicela ulungise izinsiza zakho zokufunda zemisebenzi yokugcina yethemu 4. Abafundi kufanele balandele uhlelo lwezikhathi futhi bakhulume nothisha wekilasi uma bedinga usizo.\n\nLesi saziso siyisibonelo futhi asisona isaziso esisemthethweni sesikole.","Kulondolozwe ngokuyimfihlo kule divayisi kuphela. Lokhu AKUTHUNYELWANGA kothisha bangempela noma kwabezimo eziphuthumayo. Khuluma nomuntu omdala onokwethenjelwa ukuze uthole usizo lwangempela.","Optimal Growth Technologies SA \xb7 Isibonelo esisebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\nAmarekhodi awangempela. Lolu hlelo alukagunyazwa yisikole.","Isiqondiso sombhalo \u2022 Sigcinwe kule divayisi \u2022 Ukubuka kwesibonelo\nKonke okukulesi sikrini kutholakala ngaphandle kwensizakalo yangaphandle yamadokhumenti noma yamavidiyo.","Isithombe sezincwadi ezinemibala esikhuthaza ubuciko","Incazelo: ukufunda okunembayo kusebenzisa ukuzilolonga, ukuhlola nobufakazi.","Imaki elilodwa embuzweni ngamunye onempendulo eqondile","imibuzo enezimpendulo eziqondile engaphenduliwe.","okuphawulwe ukuze kubuyekezwe.","Izinsuku zesikole ezirekhodiwe: 50","Ukhona: 48 \u2022 Akekho: 2 \u2022 Ufike sekwephuzile: 3","Izinsuku zesikole ezingama-48 kwezingama-50","Ithemu 4 \u2022 isibonelo","Okuqukethwe kwesibonelo ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","Insiza yesibonelo egcinwe kule divayisi","Insiza yesibonelo yokuqala","Ukubuka umbiko ongakagunyazwa","Buka umbiko ongakagunyazwa","IDATHA YESIBONELO \u2014 AKUWONA UMBIKO OSEMTHETHWENI WESIKOLE","Letha incwadi yakho yokusebenzela. Isihloko: ukubuyekeza ithemu. Uthisha:","Igumbi lokufundela","Igumbi","Igceke","Isikhathi sekhefu","Kuyatholakala","okutholakalayo","Kufanele kuthunyelwe ngo-","Imisebenzi emisha yethemu 4","Isifundo sakamuva","Umphumela wakamuva okhishiwe","isilinganiso esikhishiwe","Igumbi B","Unyaka wokufunda","Izifundo obhalise kuzo","Isikhathi sesifundo","Imininingwane yohlelo","izinsiza zokufunda zokuqala","igumbi lokuzilolonga","Zifudumeze ngokuphepha, uzilolonge ngesigcawu sakho esifushane futhi ucabange ngokuveza imizwa, isikhathi nokusebenzisana.","Ukuphawula kukathisha: Ukuzinikela okuhle. Zilolonge ekushintsheni izigcawu futhi weseke iqembu lakho.","Isicelo sokuqinisekisa ukuba khona ekuzilolongeni sigcinwe kule divayisi; silinde ukubuyekezwa","Vula ","Novemba","Izivivinyo","Isivivinyo","Izaziso ezibalulekile","Izinsiza ezilandiwe","Iqoqo lomsebenzi ledijithali","Ikhasi alitholakali","Izingxoxo nothisha","Bika ukukhathazeka","Ulwazi lobumfihlo","Mayelana nohlelo","Okulandiwe","Ukubuyekeza","Kugcinwe kule divayisi","Lolu hlelo alukagunyazwa yisikole.","Amarekhodi awangempela.","Isibonelo esizimele. Akushiwo ukuthi sigunyazwe yisikole. Bonke abafundi nothisha bangabalingiswa besibonelo. Idatha igcinwa kule divayisi; ungafaki imininingwane eyimfihlo. Akukho seva, zikhangiso, zinkokhelo noma zinsizakalo zangaphandle."],t.w)
